<p>Metastatic sites of the two treatment groups. In the enucleation group the metastatic sites appear in light blue, and in the irradiation group appear in dark blue.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="co-2-989f2"/></fig><fig id="f3-co-2-989" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>The chart clearly demonstrates the complications of proton beam irradiation.</p><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> CAT, cataract; IN, iris neovascularization; NG, neovascular glaucoma; CO, corneal opacification; RD, retinal detachment; RET, retinopathy; VH, vitreous hemorrhage; ON, optic neuropathy.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="co-2-989f3"/></fig></floats-group></article>